    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backrooms: Recode</strong> is a cooperative horror game for 1\u20134 players. The rules don't stay the same. Neither do the walls, the halls, or your thoughts. If there's a pattern, it's not meant for you to understand.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2>- Scary atmosphere!<br>- 1 to 4 player co-op<br>- Proximity voice chat<br>- Immersive AI<br>- Game Difficulties<br>- Stealth<br>- Large &amp; difficult map<br>- Primitive but challenging gameplay<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2>This is not a typical Backrooms game. It doesn\u2019t follow every detail from the online community. Instead, it offers a unique interpretation, integrating select elements in a fresh and atmospheric way.<br><br>The game includes flickering lights and audiovisual effects that may affect sensitive players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built using the <strong>SNK V2 system</strong> \u2014 featuring an improved main menu, enhanced lobby, online server browser, difficulty selection, player sound system (with UI feedback and AI reaction), and a dynamic visibility system based on movement, posture, and flashlight use.</p>",
